=== Exec Miscellaneous Tests (Phase 78-A-6) ===

Test 1: RawDoFmt maxwidth (string precision)
  OK: %.3s truncates to 3 chars
  OK: %.0s produces empty output
  OK: %.10s with short string outputs full string
  OK: %10.3s right-pads truncated string
  OK: %-10.3s left-aligns truncated string

Test 2: RawDoFmt %% edge cases
  OK: %%%% at start produces %%
  OK: a%%%%b%%%%c produces a%%b%%c
  OK: end%%%% produces end%%

Test 3: RawDoFmt %c specifier
  OK: %%c outputs character
  OK: %%5c right-pads character
  OK: %%-5c left-aligns character

Test 4: RawDoFmt return value
  OK: return value points past last WORD arg
  OK: return value after two WORD args
  OK: return value after LONG arg
  OK: return value after string arg

Test 5: List accessors (GetHead/GetTail/GetSucc/GetPred)
  OK: GetHead on empty list returns NULL
  OK: GetTail on empty list returns NULL
  OK: GetHead returns sole node
  OK: GetTail returns sole node
  OK: GetSucc on sole node returns NULL
  OK: GetPred on sole node returns NULL
  OK: GetHead returns first of three
  OK: GetTail returns last of three
  OK: GetSucc(A) returns B
  OK: GetSucc(B) returns C
  OK: GetSucc(C) returns NULL (tail)
  OK: GetPred(C) returns B
  OK: GetPred(B) returns A
  OK: GetPred(A) returns NULL (head)
  OK: GetSucc(NULL) returns NULL
  OK: GetPred(NULL) returns NULL
  OK: GetSucc(A) returns C after Remove(B)
  OK: GetPred(C) returns A after Remove(B)

Test 6: Alert (recovery alert)
  OK: Recovery alert returned (did not crash)
  OK: AG_OpenLib | AO_DOSLib alert returned

Test 7: Supervisor
  OK: Supervisor returned 0xADDR from superFunc

Test 8: RawDoFmt mixed format verification
  OK: mixed format: string + decimal + hex

Test 9: CachePreDMA / CachePostDMA hosted semantics
  OK: CachePreDMA returns original address
  OK: CachePreDMA preserves length
  OK: CachePostDMA returns without crashing

Test 10: InitCode with no matching resident
  OK: InitCode keeps built-in residents discoverable

Test 11: RawDoFmt BSTR format
  OK: %%b formats BSTR correctly
